OL,3,GNEWSAWorld's largest heavy lift vessel
OL,4,Acarries oil platform to Shetland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's largest lifting vessel has
OL,7,Farrived in Shetland carrying a giant
OL,8,FNorth Sea oil platform to be broken up.
OL,10,FAllseas's Pioneering Spirit is 1253ft
OL,11,F(382m) long and 407ft (124m) wide, with
OL,12,Fa 5,000 tonne crane for lifting the
OL,13,Ftopsides of platforms.
OL,15,FThe twin-hull vessel arrived in Lerwick
OL,16,FHarbour early on Saturday morning with
OL,17,Fthe North Cormorant platform on its
OL,18,Fdeck.
OL,20,FThe platform was then placed on a barge
OL,21,Fto be brought ashore to the quayside at
OL,22,FDales Voe to be decommissioned.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
